<title>USA: Pharmhouse Corp Q1 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Pharmhouse Corp Q1 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.08     loss	 $0.45</p>
<p> Net loss		     186     loss	   992</p>
<p> Revs			51,410		   57,118</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,350		    2,229</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company attributed improved first quarter results in part to improvement in retail operations arising from a cost reduction program, the favorable effects of a Woolworth settlement and the closing of three underperforming stores.</p>
